  << /ActualText (Support teams handle thousands of repetitive but high\055stakes conversations\056 Traditional chatbots fail them\072 they hallucinate answers\054 ignore company policy\054 and either take risky actions unsupervised or can\047t act at all\056 The result is wrong promises to customers and no way to reconstruct why the AI said what it said\056)
